<title>RUSSIA: Rouble lower at 5,436 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble lower at 5,436 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged down to 5,436 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,434 on Friday. Dealers said the central bank bought $0.26 million to close trading.</p>
<p>				    Oct 21		  Oct 18</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,436		   5,434</p>
<p> Volume traded (mln $)	1.13		    4.01</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
